      "body": "Closing as complete via PR #313 (merge commit 0c27ab4, on main). DoD verified on origin/main: (1) window selection responds to query text — deterministic content signal blended into session state, regression test included; (2) eigenvalue output derives from the projection — hardcoded constant replaced by six-subwindow covariance eigenvalues; (3) retrieval-quality delta measured on the fixture: top-1 0.167 / MRR 0.444 → 1.000 / 1.000 vs the #245 content-reconnection baseline (docs/zeta_projection_246.md). GloVe fate decided: zeta-only is the intended design, tombstone rationale documented. Verified 2026-08-01: cargo test -p uor-r4-router green (32 passed), including tests/zeta_projection_quality.rs.",
